msgstr "舵机/电机输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-heewingf405.rst:96
#: 8544c37ca6ef4dbdb78d7d08c26ef2de
msgid ""
"The HEEWING F405 supports up to 9 PWM outputs. M1-M2, M5-M6 and M9 support "
"bi-directional dshot. All outputs support dshot although M3-4 are not "
"recommended for this purpose as they share resources with I2C."
msgstr ""
"HEEWING F405 最多支持 9 路 PWM 输出。M1-M2、M5-M6 和 M9 支持双向 DShot。所有输出均支持 DShot，但不建议将"
" M3-4 用于此目的，因为它们与 I2C 共享资源。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-heewingf405.rst:98
#: 3db4dd30920c48088fca84a1b6e6ab58
msgid "The PWM is in 4 groups:"
msgstr "PWM 分为 4 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-heewingf405.rst:100
#: 858ab9136821448dbcc748d2c9a19fdc
msgid "PWM 1 and 2 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1 和 2 为第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-heewingf405.rst:101
#: cc7e5f6957a64f6bb0f5aac2cbcba4f1
msgid "PWM 3 and 4 in group2"
msgstr "PWM 3 和 4 为第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-heewingf405.rst:102
#: f10444d077dc4861af0dd4a1a26e0d69
msgid "PWM 5 and 6 in group3"
msgstr "PWM 5 和 6 为第 3 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-heewingf405.rst:103
#: ff6667990ba74231ad382f23a72bb3fc
msgid "PWM 7-9 in group4"
msgstr "PWM 7-9 为第 4 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-heewingf405.rst:105
#: c772971205644a5fb0aa00c39ce233d1
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any "
"channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use "
"DShot."
msgstr "同一组内的通道必须使用相同的输出速率。如果某组中任一通道使用 DShot，则该组中所有通道都必须使用 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-heewingf405.rst:108
#: 03b8755289044f36bf1a949cbf482e35
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-heewingf405.rst:110
#: 8c1e7016c15f4bc0aaed441433c196d5
msgid ""
"The RCIN pin, is passed by an inverter to RX2 (UART2 RX), which by default "
"is mapped to a timer input instead of the UART, and can be used for all "
"ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which "
"require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this "
"manner, can provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""
"RCIN 引脚经过反相器后接到 RX2（UART2 RX），默认映射为定时器输入而非 UART，支持所有 ArduPilot 支持的接收机协议，但 "
"CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 除外（它们需要真正的 UART 连接）。但是，以此方式连接的 FPort 只能提供 RC 信号而无数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-heewingf405.rst:112
#: cdf647af295a429a99842a84532aa7cb
msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, the RX2 pin can also be configured to be used as true UART2 RX "
"pin for use with bi-directional systems by setting the "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` to “1” so it becomes the SERIAL2 "
"port's RX input pin."
msgstr ""
"要允许 FPort、CRSF 和 SRXL2 接收机使用 CRSF 和内嵌数传，可通过将 "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` 设置为 「1」，将 RX2 引脚配置为真正的 UART2 RX "
"引脚，以支持双向系统，使其成为 SERIAL2 端口的 RX 输入引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-heewingf405.rst:114
#: 79604bb3358a40529a5b317dcb1cc2ba
msgid ""
"With this option, :ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` must be set to "
"\"23\", and:"
msgstr "使用此选项时，:ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` 必须设置为 「23」，并且："

#: ../../source/docs/common-heewingf405.rst:116
#: 1569e9ea210d446684d8b66edc3fcb89
msgid "PPM/SBUS is not supported."
msgstr "不支持 PPM/SBUS。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-heewingf405.rst:118
#: d140857ba1c94c4fa06c2dbf12a78a56
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to TX2 and RX2 via a bi-directional inverter. See "
":ref:`common-FPort-receivers`."
msgstr "FPort 需通过双向电平转换器连接至 TX2 和 RX2。请参阅 :ref:`common-FPort-receivers`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-heewingf405.rst:120
#: e169eb30cdbd4f2bab01d3d39edc7619
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a TX2 connection, in addition to RX2, and automatically "
"provides telemetry."
msgstr "CRSF 除需要 RX2 外还需要 TX2 连接，并自动提供数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-heewingf405.rst:122
#: 17677e8f712f4216bd00d21df06dec21
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to TX2 and automatically provides telemetry.  "
"Set :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需连接至 TX2 并自动提供数传回传。将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设为「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-heewingf405.rst:124
#: e9b3801246064a3db02f8dc9d664b579
msgid ""
"UART2 is configured by default for serial receivers. You can also have more "
"than one receiver in the system at a time (usually used for long range hand-"
"offs to a remote TX). See :ref:`common-multiple-rx` for details."
msgstr ""
"UART2 默认配置为串行接收机。系统中也可同时拥有多个接收机（通常用于远程切换到远距离手持设备）。详情请参见 :ref:`common-"
"multiple-rx`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-heewingf405.rst:126
#: 82159e22920740378d897870909fa9af
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM (SBUS requires external inversion "
"on other UARTs). See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details."
msgstr ""
"任意 UART 也可用于 ArduPilot 中的 RC 系统连接，兼容除 PPM 以外的所有协议（SBUS 在其他 UART "
"上需要外部反相器）。详情参见 :ref:`common-rc-systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-heewingf405.rst:129
#: 4604457b524845799b84fc7745afc1e4
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-heewingf405.rst:131
#: e4e0635487f24fd1993dbc0daaf3c50b
msgid ""
"The HEEWINGF405 supports using its internal OSD using OSD_TYPE 1 (MAX7456 "
"driver). External OSD support such as DJI or DisplayPort is supported using "
"any free UART. See :ref:`common-msp-osd-overview-4.2` for more info."
msgstr ""
"HEEWINGF405 支持使用 OSD_TYPE 1（MAX7456 驱动）的内置 OSD。通过任意空闲 UART 也支持外部 OSD，如 DJI 或"
" DisplayPort。更多信息请参见 :ref:`common-msp-osd-overview-4.2`。"

