#: ../../source/docs/common-heewingf405.rst:154
#: 3231325360f94e09ac895dc431d0abff
msgid ""
"This board does not include a GPS or compass so an :ref:`external "
"GPS/compass <common-positioning-landing-page>` should be connected in order "
"for autonomous modes to function."
msgstr ""
"此飞控不含 GPS 或罗盘，需连接 :ref:`外部 GPS/罗盘 <common-positioning-landing-page>` "
"方可使用自主飞行模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-heewingf405.rst:157
#: d6dfdf0571d34cc9b7a2f05791d8b43e
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-heewingf405.rst:159
#: f7da6ef635064c6ca92b8c069c268500
msgid "First Versions"
msgstr "初版"

#: ../../source/docs/common-heewingf405.rst:160
#: cac1f9dbc53e464394a4bdce1f561aac
msgid ""
"The first version of the board does not come a correct Ardupilot bootloader "
"(it may at some future point) so it cannot be upgraded with new versions of "
"Ardupilot firmware. ANd cecause it has not boot pin exposed, DFU loading is "
"not possible."
msgstr ""
"第一版板子未附带正确的 ArduPilot 引导程序（未来某个时间点可能会提供），因此无法升级到新版 ArduPilot "
"固件。由于没有暴露启动引脚，DFU 加载也不可行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-heewingf405.rst:162
#: 4e25d91290a44f99828b78c73264f8c8
msgid ""
"Instead a `\"transitional\" firmware "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/TransitionalFirmware/HeeWingF405/>`__"
"  can be used and loaded like normal ArduPilot firmware (this is rev 4.3.7 "
"Plane firmware) as a custom firmware file in Mission Planner."
msgstr ""
"可以使用 `「过渡」固件 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/TransitionalFirmware/HeeWingF405/>`__，并像正常"
" ArduPilot 固件一样加载（这是 rev 4.3.7 Plane 固件），在 Mission Planner 中作为自定义固件文件加载。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-heewingf405.rst:164
#: c4bb827decd14ca2a142e1d9e2811038
msgid ""
"This firmware contains the correct bootloader and it can be installed using "
"the Mission Planner: SETUP->Install firmware \"Bootloader Update\" button "
"after this firmware is loaded. From then on you can load any ArduPilot "
"future firmware versions you desire, normally."
msgstr ""
"该固件包含正确的引导程序，加载此固件后可使用 Mission Planner：SETUP->Install firmware「Bootloader "
"Update」按钮进行安装。此后即可正常加载您希望的任何未来 ArduPilot 固件版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-heewingf405.rst:166
#: cb444fd25954487b9a1ca8523d7d4699
msgid ""
"Firmware for this board can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ in  sub-folders labeled \"HEEWING-F405\"."
msgstr ""
"此板的固件可在 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ 找到，位于标注为「HEEWING-F405」的子文件夹中。"

